      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "Code can be reasoned about by reading it; agents have prompts, tools, skills, hooks, middlewares and swarms, and prompt effects vary by domain.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:03:29.560..00:04:19.600",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-continual-learning-axes",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
      "artifact_id": "captions-auto-en-json",
      "artifact_modality": "transcript",
      "artifact_role": "subject-matter-source",
      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "Continual learning runs across three axes: observational training data, harness updates, and memory that is not an append-only log.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:16:51.600..00:18:49.160",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-dense-feedback",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
      "artifact_id": "captions-auto-en-json",
      "artifact_modality": "transcript",
      "artifact_role": "subject-matter-source",
      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "A pass/fail number is a sparse signal; densifying feedback improves agents and traces are the substrate that holds that feedback.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:14:33.440..00:16:01.560",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-determinism-for-autonomy",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
      "artifact_id": "captions-auto-en-json",
      "artifact_modality": "transcript",
      "artifact_role": "subject-matter-source",
      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "Over four years since the ChatGPT moment the field has been trading determinism for autonomy.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:04:19.600..00:04:43.280",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-harness-ceiling-finetune",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
      "artifact_id": "captions-auto-en-json",
      "artifact_modality": "transcript",
      "artifact_role": "subject-matter-source",
      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "Harness engineering gives instant feedback but saturates at an intelligence threshold; fine-tuning base models on narrow vertical tasks can reach and exceed frontier performance.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:09:00.920..00:09:51.480",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-harness-finetune-sandwich",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
      "artifact_id": "captions-auto-en-json",
      "artifact_modality": "transcript",
      "artifact_role": "subject-matter-source",
      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "Collect feedback as fast as possible; harness engineering answers in about two minutes; on saturating its ceiling try fine-tuning, then return to harness engineering.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:16:01.560..00:16:51.600",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-model-harness-task-fit",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
      "artifact_id": "captions-auto-en-json",
      "artifact_modality": "transcript",
      "artifact_role": "subject-matter-source",
      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "The scikit-learn fit analogy generalizes to model-harness-task fit; the jobs become finding good fit functions and finding good data.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:12:45.960..00:14:33.440",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-observability-coupling",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
      "artifact_id": "captions-auto-en-json",
      "artifact_modality": "transcript",
      "artifact_role": "subject-matter-source",
      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "Tight coupling stated between observability and continual learning: you need traces to do continual learning.",
      "locator": "timestamp:00:02:21.800..00:03:08.600",
      "source_dependency_key": "youtube-video:CvRngaQZQ3Y"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "EV-cvrngaqzq3y-v2-open-model-judge-cost",
      "anchor_kind": "evidence",
