      "artifact_sha256": "sha256:304e9a058721298f7498906d2539fdabdac515f2304645d52824e6719bc5f9bf",
      "description": "Traces centralized in a tracing project; agents read other agents' traces to find good and bad interactions, post-compaction degradation, and model counterfactuals.",
